\begin{enumerate}
    \item Calculate the total time in seconds:
        - It takes 2 seconds to paint one dimple.
        - There are 300 dimples.
        - Total time in seconds = 2 seconds/dimple * 300 dimples = 600 seconds.
    \item Convert seconds to minutes:
        - There are 60 seconds in 1 minute.
        - Total time in minutes = 600 seconds / 60 seconds/minute = 10 minutes.
\end{enumerate}
Therefore, Casey will need 10 minutes to paint the golf trophy.
