Let $d = 20$. Then $x+y = \frac{80}{20} = 4$. We can have $x=1, y=3$, $\gcd(1,3)=1$. Then $a = 20(1) = 20$ and $b = 20(3) = 60$. $\gcd(20,60) = 20$.
